    "You won’t always see it—but AI is watching your systems around the clock.",
    "Machine learning models are woven into monitoring platforms to spot patterns humans miss. Whether it's a slow memory leak, abnormal server load, or a spike in traffic, AI alerts you before minor glitches snowball into downtime.",
